    "name": {
      "value": "Major Saurian Spike"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This jagged, bony growth narrows to a sharp, pointed tip. Deep groves from some former battle scar its surface. The bearer of a saurian spike often feels a sudden surge in power and confidence.\n\n- - **Armor:** You gain imprecise scent with a range of 30 feet.\n- - **Weapon:** (auditory, emotion, fear, visual) When you cast a polymorph spell by activating the spike, your battle form is exceptionally fearsome. Each enemy in a 30-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 27 Will saving throw or become frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure).\n\nYou cast gouging claw.\n\nThe range of the scent and fear emanation are both 60 feet. The scent is precise instead of imprecise, and creatures that fail their saves are frightened 2 (frightened 3 on a critical failure) with a DC 34 save.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast 7th-level dinosaur form."
    },
